The MIT License of the upstream `fathah/hermes-desktop` is preserved
in LICENSE and governs this derivative work.

Modifications in this fork include:
- Full visual rebrand to OLYMPUS brand (logo, colors, typography)
- SplashScreen reimplemented as programmatic SVG + CSS animation
- i18n strings in 31 locales updated from "Hermes One" to "OLYMPUS"
- Application identifiers changed to com.kyrius.olympus
- CI pipelines adapted for self-signed APK + signed releases
- Security patches to resolve 10 npm vulnerabilities (see CHANGELOG.md)

All modifications are documented in CHANGELOG.md and visible in the
commit history on GitHub.
